            "answer": "Triple-weighted pieces have iron or brass weights cast directly into the hollow core of the plastic or wood piece. This increases the weight of the set (usually around 3 to 4 lbs total). Weighted pieces feel robust in hand, slide smoothly, and are extremely stable, preventing them from tipping over during blitz matches."
